// (x, z); the player's mech faces -z down its street at the start. Enemies wear a rust tint and
// carry a light 25 mm autocannon and light armour (55 %): raiders, not the player's equal. Their brain (cb-core::ai, after Mining Mike's autopilot) orbits at
